><surname>Warren</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Sweet</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fat embolism in acute pancreatitis</article-title><source>Arch Pathol Lab Med</source><year>1989</year><volume>113</volume><fpage>503</fpage><lpage>506</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2712672</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Flaggl</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Heer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hany</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Branda</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Loss of vision as a complication of acute pancreatitis</article-title><source>Schweiz Med Wochenschr</source><year>1988</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>722</fpage><lpage>725</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3387968</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hackelbusch</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fat embolism of retinal arteries following acute pancreatitis</article-title><source>Klin Monatsbl Augenheilkd</source><year>1984</year><volume>185</volume><fpage>50</fpage><lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6482286</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bhalla</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Sachdev</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh Lehl</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>D'Cruz</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cerebral fat embolism as a rare possible complication of traumatic pancreatitis</article-title><source>JOP</source><year>2003</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>155</fpage><lpage>157</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12853683</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>